{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel journeyed.</b> After the victory in battle, the men went back and brought their wives and children who had been encamped across the Arnon in the desert. <b>And they encamped in the plains of Moab.</b> From the Arnon to the Jabbok. <b>End of the section of Perashat Chukat.</b>"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:10.501447635Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}